# Line endings are not a local preference here. Builds, the public audit and packaged
# verification compare these trees byte for byte, and the release manifest pins their
# digests, so every checkout must produce the same bytes on every platform. Nothing in
# the tree is a Windows script, so LF everywhere costs nothing.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Redistributed upstream license text and generated supply-chain notices are artifacts,
# not source: their exact bytes are the identity being asserted. Never convert them.
LICENSE -text
NOTICE.txt -text
*.NOTICE.txt -text
OFL.txt -text
